{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54692","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 三十 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 三十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太阳畔，九曜旋（辛本、川本、京本作「簇」）於边。\n似火如灯光烂烂（京本作「烨烨」），九州大乱水滔天（京本作「血流川」），王道苦（京本作「若」）忧煎。\n（又主兵戈。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54692.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54692","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}